WEBVTT

1
00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:42.412
Policies shows your organisation policies, who has acknowledged them and whether their rules hold.

2
00:00:46.795 --> 00:00:49.270
Filter to the policies with an open alert.

3
00:00:54.126 --> 00:00:55.491
Back to all policies.

4
00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:06.124
Enforce rules now checks every published rule against every system.

5
00:01:08.867 --> 00:01:14.051
The agent can draft a policy from a short brief. It saves a draft for people to review.

6
00:01:18.404 --> 00:01:21.668
We stop before drafting, because this demo is read-only.
